# Label propagation (max-label; computes connected components) -- ASCII surface form of einsum.md
# from convos with Claude AI

- Tensors
G^{R = N, C = N} -> float, empty = 0.0
L^{I, R = N}     -> float, empty = 0.0

- Initialization
G   -> <user-specified>          # symmetric, reflexive adjacency (1.0 edge weights)
L_0 -> <user-specified>          # unique per-vertex labels, label(v) = v + 1; ALL vertices (no source set)

- Extended Einsum
L_{i+1, d} = G_{s, d} . L_{i, s}  :: /\_s *(∩) \/_s max(∪)
<> : L_{i+1} == L_i
